Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: aegis-desktop
Architecture: amd64
Depends: aegis-compositor, ${misc:Depends}
Description: The AEGIS OS desktop (metapackage)
 Pulls in the complete AEGIS desktop: the Rust compositor, the shell
 (island + dock), the Aegis apps, the icon theme and the branding.
 As the Rust migration rounds land (terminal, files, music, store,
 settings), each becomes a Depends here.
